      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALL I SEE (7) missed the frame and safely held latest finishing 7th at Sandown following on from a win (25.87) at this track the start prior. Can make amends. RIVERS MEET (1) showed good speed off a low draw but weakened and run over late when 5th over 525m at The Meadows in Grade 5 company. Cannot be left out. BABY BEETS (2) had been in super honest form hitting the frame two times on end before finishing fourth (30.46) at The Meadows last time. Form here sound including three wins. Should be in this for a long way. PAW FABLE (5) collected a minor prize last start and must be considered.",
